!feature_counts_output/counts.txt
!feature_counts_output/counts.txt.summary

# Verbose strandedness-test dump (4.8 MB); the conclusion (-s 0, unstranded) is in the README.
# The small .summary is kept as evidence.
/strandedness_test_s0.txt

